license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://rankrhq.com/chatgpt-recommendations-singapore"
abstract: >-
  1,300 answers from ChatGPT (OpenAI web search, through the API) and Perplexity (sonar, through the API) to
  the same five questions about 15 Singapore trades, each question asked ten times: 11 trades asked of both
  assistants on 5 and 6 October 2026 (1,100 answers) and four of ChatGPT on 18 November 2026 (200 answers),
  with every business named and every citation.
keywords:
